# 🎬 InsideMoviz - AI Movie Chatbot with TMDB API

InsideMoviz एक स्मार्ट वेब एप्लिकेशन है जिसमें:
- ✅ Real-time Movie Data आता है TMDB API से
- 🤖 एक Simple Chatbot है जो Movie Recommend करता है
- 🧠 User Input समझकर movie suggest करता है

---

## 🔧 Features

- Fetches real movie data using **TMDB API**
- AI-powered basic chatbot for recommending movies
- Users can interact via a clean chat interface
- Toggle chatbot open/close
- Uses modern HTML, CSS, JavaScript (No frameworks)

---

## 🚀 How to Run Locally

1. Clone or download this repo
2. Open `index.html` in your browser
3. Make sure internet is on (to access API)

---

## 🌐 Technologies Used

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript (Vanilla)
- TMDB API

---

## 📦 API Used

**The Movie Database (TMDB) API**  
URL: [https://www.themoviedb.org/documentation/api](https://www.themoviedb.org/documentation/api)

---

## 💡 Future Improvements

- Smarter AI with NLP (ChatGPT integration)
- Filter by genre/year
